\fs36 \cf0 This script will create a text file listing the file paths of any audio files which are not in iTunes' database. The default folder searched is your designated "Music" folder, however you can select any folder that may contain audio files at any level.\
\
This script relies on Spotlight and thus requires Mac OS X 10.4 or better.\
\pard\tx160\tx560\tx1120\tx1680\tx2240\tx2800\tx3360\tx3920\tx4480\tx5040\tx5600\tx6160\tx6720\li200\fi-20\ql\qnatural

